1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
How to create a virtual model with a virtual model

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
AI pose generator

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Use keywords or reference pictures to easily create a virtual model pose.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Click on the virtual model in the top menu.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
AI model pose generator

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
You can enter keywords to create a reference picture or upload a reference picture directly.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
First, select gender.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Click on the keyword suggestion.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Click on the keyword suggestion to help you choose the right keyword.

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Click on Keep Keywords.

11
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Even if you use the same keywords, the AI pose picture will be re-created every time.

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Therefore, click on the Keep Keywords button to keep the existing results as much as possible while updating the keywords.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
According to the addition or modification of keywords, the results may be different from the existing results.

14
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Click on random keywords.

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
The system will provide random,

16
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
random keywords.

17
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Enter words that describe accurate words and not long sentences to generate more effective results.

18
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Then, enter keywords.

19
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Click on the Create button to create a virtual model pose based on your image.

20
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,000
When there are more online users, the creation process may take some time.

21
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Format features

22
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Switch from the Keyword Select Card to the Picture Select Card.

23
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:51,000
The picture in the background is a reference picture to upload the image.

24
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Click on the upload button to add an image which fits the following guidelines.

25
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:05,000
It is highly recommended to use full-body images from head to toe to ensure high-quality AI posture.

26
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:19,000
Click the Save button to save the posture as a PAUSE file.

27
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Now you can apply it to the virtual model you choose.

28
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:47,000
After creating a posture, you can turn on the display virtual model joints to adjust the posture.

29
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,000
You can also use the shortcut keys.

30
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:56,000
That's all for this video. See you in the next video.

